[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0010","text":"感谢您的来电\n这里是２８３事务所"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0020","text":"好的，如果是那件事的话──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0040","text":"……还是改天再来吧\n也不是非得现在马上处理的事──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0050","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0060","text":"咲耶小姐、雾子小姐，怎么了～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0070","text":"不好意思，打扰您打电话了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0080","text":"没关系的哦～\n已经讲完了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0090","text":"是有什么事吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_03_0100","text":"关于要提交的文件，有些事情想请教您"}]
